stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Admission
    Admission --> Session: valid request
    Session --> Delivered: stored turn replay
    Session --> Conflict: stale revision or active turn
    Session --> ImmediateReply: greeting or policy refusal
    ImmediateReply --> Commit: preserve prior topic and scope
    Session --> Resolve: archive question
    Resolve --> Calculate: prefetch or model tool choice
    Calculate --> Draft: authoritative metric and aggregation
    Draft --> SelectEvidence: ProposedAnswer references
    SelectEvidence --> Gate: declared claims, baselines and receipts
    Gate --> Review: same selected evidence
    Gate --> Repair: validation feedback and capacity
    Review --> Deliver: accepted
    Review --> Repair: rejected and capacity remains
    Repair --> SelectEvidence: flat ProposedAnswer
    Repair --> Fallback: invalid or out of time
    Review --> Fallback: no remaining repair capacity
    Fallback --> Deliver: selected facts or explicit limitation
    Deliver --> Commit: session available
    Deliver --> Uncommitted: storage unavailable
    Commit --> Delivered: committed or canonical replay
    Commit --> Uncommitted: commit failed
    Delivered --> [*]
    Uncommitted --> [*]
    Conflict --> [*]
